<title>SPAIN: POLL-BBV H1 net attributable seen up 25.7 pct.</title>
<headline>POLL-BBV H1 net attributable seen up 25.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forecasts for first-half results for Spain's Banco Bilbao Vizcaya (BBV) group. Numbers in billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>				   H1 97	  H1 96	 RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income   254.15	 200.12   250.15-260.00</p>
<p>    Operating income	150.90	 116.51   146.73-156.36</p>
<p>    Net attributable	 58.02	  46.15    56.31-58.60</p>
<p>NOTE - The group will release results at the end of July.</p>
<p>Contributors: BBV Interactivos, Benito y Monjardin, Inverban, AB Asesores, Ahorro Corp, Beta Capital.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +3 41 585 2167</p>
</text>
